References: 
Tarumi, K., & Yoshizawa, K. (2026). A Comprehensive Catalog of Horizontal-Component Sensor Orientations at FDSN Stations, 1986 to 2025., SSJ Fall meeting 2026, in prep. for Seismca
Tarumi, K., & Yoshizawa, K. (2025). Station-Orientation Catalog for Australian Broadband Seismic Stations. Pure and Applied Geophysics. https://doi.org/10.1007/s00024-025-03827-7

